    "items": [
      {
        "type": "heading1",
        "verse_numbers": [],
        "lines": [
          "Fallen, Fallen Is Babylon"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          1
        ],
        "lines": [
          "The oracle concerning the wilderness of the sea.",
          "As whirlwinds in the Negeb sweep on,",
          "it comes from the wilderness,",
          "from a terrible land."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          2
        ],
        "lines": [
          "A stern vision is told to me;",
          "the traitor betrays,",
          "and the destroyer destroys.",
          "Go up, O Elam;",
          "lay siege, O Media;",
          "all the sighing she has caused",
          "I bring to an end."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          3
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Therefore my loins are filled with anguish;",
          "pangs have seized me,",
          "like the pangs of a woman in labor;",
          "I am bowed down so that I cannot hear;",
          "I am dismayed so that I cannot see."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          4
        ],
        "lines": [
          "My heart staggers; horror has appalled me;",
          "the twilight I longed for",
          "has been turned for me into trembling."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          5
        ],
        "lines": [
          "They prepare the table,",
          "they spread the rugs,",
          "they eat, they drink.",
          "Arise, O princes;",
          "oil the shield!"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          6
        ],
        "lines": [
          "For thus the Lord said to me:",
          "“Go, set a watchman;",
          "let him announce what he sees."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          7
        ],
        "lines": [
          "When he sees riders, horsemen in pairs,",
          "riders on donkeys, riders on camels,",
          "let him listen diligently,",
          "very diligently.”"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          8
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Then he who saw cried out:",
          "“Upon a watchtower I stand, O Lord,",
          "continually by day,",
          "and at my post I am stationed",
          "whole nights."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          9
        ],
        "lines": [
          "And behold, here come riders,",
          "horsemen in pairs!”",
          "And he answered,",
          "“Fallen, fallen is Babylon;",
          "and all the carved images of her gods",
          "he has shattered to the ground.”"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          10
        ],
        "lines": [
          "O my threshed and winnowed one,",
          "what I have heard from the Lord of hosts,",
          "the God of Israel, I announce to you."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          11
        ],
        "lines": [
          "The oracle concerning Dumah.",
          "One is calling to me from Seir,",
          "“Watchman, what time of the night?",
          "Watchman, what time of the night?”"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          12
        ],
        "lines": [
          "The watchman says:",
          "“Morning comes, and also the night.",
          "If you will inquire, inquire;",
          "come back again.”"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          13
        ],
        "lines": [
          "The oracle concerning Arabia.",
          "In the thickets in Arabia you will lodge,",
          "O caravans of Dedanites."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          14
        ],
        "lines": [
          "To the thirsty bring water;",
          "meet the fugitive with bread,",
          "O inhabitants of the land of Tema."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          15
        ],
        "lines": [
          "For they have fled from the swords,",
          "from the drawn sword,",
          "from the bent bow,",
          "and from the press of battle."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          16
        ],
        "lines": [
          "For thus the Lord said to me, “Within a year, according to the years of a hired worker, all the glory of Kedar will come to an end."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          17
        ],
        "lines": [
          "And the remainder of the archers of the mighty men of the sons of Kedar will be few, for the Lord, the God of Israel, has spoken.”"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      }
    ]
  },
